@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
allowmixing
title Proposed — Artifact, reference and operation classes
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

class ArtifactRecord <<File identity>>
class EffectiveFilePolicy
class Reservation
class ProtectedReference
class StorageAttempt <<Operation>>
class WorkReference <<Job identity>>
class RecoveryAssessment
class Folder <<optional logical grouping, unselected>>
class VersionReference <<consumer-owned association>>
class PermissionContext <<current authority, not permanent grant>>
class ShareLink <<Sharing-owned, external to Files>>
ArtifactRecord --> ProtectedReference
Reservation --> EffectiveFilePolicy
StorageAttempt --> Reservation
WorkReference --> StorageAttempt
VersionReference --> ArtifactRecord
Folder ..> ArtifactRecord : optional label/group, not canonical storage path
ShareLink ..> ArtifactRecord : only through owner eligibility and Files contract
PermissionContext ..> ArtifactRecord : current admission context
RecoveryAssessment ..> ArtifactRecord

note "MVP private library: supported video/audio/images/text/docs.\nOptional per-resume selection; upload does not publish.\nPrivate bytes on SAME core server; direct/range authorization." as MVPLibrary
@enduml
